+-------------------------------------------------------
+<a name="onIdle"></a>
+### queue.onIdle() => Promise
+
+Waits for the queue to become idle. Each call returns an independent promise
+that resolves when `running()` is zero and `length()` is zero. An already idle
+queue returns a resolved promise. A paused queue with pending tasks is not idle.
+
+This does not alter or replace the `drain` callback.
+
